# GA Conversion Predictor

An ML project for predicting whether a user will perform a target action during a session.

# Dataset
The project uses Google Analytics session and hit data.
The original dataset is not included in this repository because of its size.
Required files:
- `ga_sessions.csv`
- `ga_hits.csv`
Download the dataset and place the files into this directory before running the project.
https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1a_CYUGYJZ-k2M3eU0ukTJ-JXtMQHB_E3?usp=share_link

## Task
Predict whether a user will perform at least one target action during a session.

## Data
- `data/ga_sessions.csv`
- `data/ga_hits.csv`

## Training
Run the train.py script:
python train.py

## Running the API
Activate the project environment and install the required dependencies:
```terminal
source actavate Final_Work
pip install "fastapi[all]"
cd ~/"Final Work"
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

## API Endpoints
- `GET /status` - check the API status
- `GET /version` - get detailed model information
- `POST /predict` - get a prediction